IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BOPSBK.

*> Application-consistent backup/restore (GATE 4).
*> Packages: var/bkp/<tag>/data, /journal, /audit, /etc + manifest.txt
*> (relative paths, sorted).  CREATE refuses unless the caller has put
*> the system in DRAINING/STOPPED first (checked by the CLI): the copy
*> is taken only while no work is being accepted.  VERIFY checks that
*> every manifest member exists and matches the live tree where the
*> live file still exists; divergence is reported, never silently
*> rewritten.  APPLY refuses without the CONFIRM-RESTORE token and
*> while RUNNING.  Secrets are never copied beyond etc/, which is
*> already excluded from key material by config rules.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT MAN-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-MAN-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-MAN-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD MAN-FILE.
01 MAN-LINE PIC X(300).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-TAG PIC X(24).
01 WS-MAN-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-MAN-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-CMD PIC X(600).
01 WS-ARG PIC X(600).
01 WS-ARG2 PIC X(600).
01 WS-P1 PIC X(300).
01 WS-P2 PIC X(300).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-CNT PIC 9(05).
01 WS-CNT-FOR PIC 9(04).
01 WS-SLASH PIC 9(04).
01 WS-MISS PIC 9(05).
01 WS-DIFF PIC 9(05).
01 WS-OK PIC X(01).
01 WS-I PIC 9(02).
01 WS-C PIC X(01).
01 WS-ACT PIC X(12).
COPY "BKAUDP".
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKBKUPP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-BKU-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO KU-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO KU-MSG
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE KU-TAG TO WS-TAG
    PERFORM VALIDATE-TAG
    IF KU-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(KU-OP)
        WHEN "CREATE" PERFORM DO-CREATE
        WHEN "VERIFY" PERFORM DO-VERIFY
        WHEN "RESTORE-VERIFY" PERFORM DO-RESTORE-VERIFY
        WHEN "APPLY" PERFORM DO-APPLY
        WHEN "LIST" PERFORM DO-LIST
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "99" TO KU-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN BACKUP OP" TO KU-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

VALIDATE-TAG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-TAG
    MOVE KU-TAG TO WS-TAG
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CNT-FOR
    INSPECT WS-TAG TALLYING WS-CNT-FOR FOR ALL "/"
    MOVE 0 TO WS-SLASH
    INSPECT WS-TAG TALLYING WS-SLASH FOR ALL "."
    ADD WS-SLASH TO WS-CNT-FOR
    IF WS-CNT-FOR > 0
        MOVE "20" TO KU-RC
        MOVE "INVALID TAG (slashes/dots)" TO KU-MSG
    END-IF.

TAG-DIR.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-P1
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/bkp/"
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TAG) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-P1
    END-STRING.

DO-CREATE.
    PERFORM TAG-DIR
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "mkdir -p " DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/data " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/journal " DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/audit " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/etc"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/data/. " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/data/"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        PERFORM CREATE-FAIL
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/journal/. " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/journal/"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        PERFORM CREATE-FAIL
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/audit/. " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/audit/"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        PERFORM CREATE-FAIL
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/etc/. " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/etc/"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        PERFORM CREATE-FAIL
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM WRITE-MANIFEST
    MOVE "BK.CREATE" TO WS-ACT
    PERFORM AUDIT-OP
    MOVE "BACKUP CREATED" TO KU-MSG
    DISPLAY "files=" KU-COUNT.

CREATE-FAIL.
    MOVE "20" TO KU-RC
    MOVE "BACKUP COPY FAILED" TO KU-MSG
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "rm -rf " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD.

WRITE-MANIFEST.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-MAN-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/manifest.txt" DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-MAN-PATH
    END-STRING
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cd " DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1)
        " && find data journal audit etc -type f 2>/dev/null"
        " | sort > manifest.txt" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    MOVE 0 TO KU-COUNT
    OPEN INPUT MAN-FILE
    IF WS-MAN-ST = "00"
        PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
            READ MAN-FILE
                AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
                NOT AT END ADD 1 TO KU-COUNT
            END-READ
        END-PERFORM
    END-IF
    CLOSE MAN-FILE.

DO-VERIFY.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-OK
    PERFORM TAG-DIR
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CNT
    MOVE 0 TO WS-MISS
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-MAN-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/manifest.txt" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-MAN-PATH
    END-STRING
    OPEN INPUT MAN-FILE
    IF WS-MAN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO KU-RC
        MOVE "NO MANIFEST IN PACKAGE" TO KU-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ MAN-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                ADD 1 TO WS-CNT
                MOVE SPACES TO WS-ARG
                STRING "test -f " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/"
                    DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(MAN-LINE)
                    DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-ARG
                END-STRING
                CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-ARG
                IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
                    ADD 1 TO WS-MISS
                    DISPLAY "VERIFY-MISSING "
                        FUNCTION TRIM(MAN-LINE)
                END-IF
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE MAN-FILE
    MOVE WS-CNT TO KU-COUNT
    IF WS-MISS > 0
        MOVE "20" TO KU-RC
        MOVE "PACKAGE INCOMPLETE" TO KU-MSG
    ELSE
        MOVE "PACKAGE COMPLETE" TO KU-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-RESTORE-VERIFY.
    PERFORM DO-VERIFY
    IF KU-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO WS-DIFF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    OPEN INPUT MAN-FILE
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ MAN-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                MOVE SPACES TO WS-ARG
                MOVE SPACES TO WS-ARG2
                STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/"
                    DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(MAN-LINE)
                    DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-ARG
                END-STRING
                STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/" DELIMITED SIZE
                    FUNCTION TRIM(MAN-LINE) DELIMITED SIZE
                    INTO WS-ARG2
                END-STRING
                MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
                STRING "cmp -s " DELIMITED SIZE WS-ARG
                    " " DELIMITED SIZE WS-ARG2 DELIMITED SIZE
                    INTO WS-CMD
                END-STRING
                CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
                IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
                    ADD 1 TO WS-DIFF
                    DISPLAY "LIVE-DIVERGED " FUNCTION TRIM(MAN-LINE)
                END-IF
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE MAN-FILE
    DISPLAY "diverged=" WS-DIFF.

DO-APPLY.
    IF KU-CONFIRM NOT = "CONFIRM-RESTORE"
        MOVE "20" TO KU-RC
        MOVE "RESTORE REQUIRES CONFIRM-RESTORE" TO KU-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM DO-VERIFY
    IF KU-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "mv " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/data " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/data.precall." FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TAG)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "mkdir -p " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/data" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/data/. "
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        MOVE "20" TO KU-RC
        MOVE "RESTORE APPLY FAILED" TO KU-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "rm -rf " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/journal " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/audit" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "mkdir -p " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/journal " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/audit" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/journal/. "
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/journal/"
        DELIMITED SIZE " && cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE
                    FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1)
        "/audit/. " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/audit/" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        MOVE "20" TO KU-RC
        MOVE "RESTORE LOGS FAILED" TO KU-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "cp -a " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-P1) "/etc/. "
        DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/etc/"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD
    MOVE "BK.APPLY" TO WS-ACT
    PERFORM AUDIT-OP
    MOVE "RESTORE APPLIED" TO KU-MSG.

DO-LIST.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CMD
    STRING "ls " DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME)
        "/var/bkp 2>/dev/null" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CMD
    END-STRING
    CALL "SYSTEM" USING WS-CMD.

AUDIT-OP.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE KU-OPERATOR TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    MOVE WS-ACT TO BK-AUD-ACTION
    MOVE "BACKUP" TO BK-AUD-ENTITY
    MOVE KU-CORR TO BK-AUD-CORR
    MOVE WS-TAG TO BK-AUD-BEFORE
    MOVE KU-MSG TO BK-AUD-AFTER
    MOVE KU-RC TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    CALL "BAUD" USING BK-AUD-PARMS.
